<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  BIOME_TIER_CLEANUP_1 (2026-11-02): the free biome mods' own RUT_-prefixed defs were renamed RM_ in place
  (moving them to the campaign layer would strip the free biomes of their own content; Sump note and Fever Wood
  card 2026-10-02 in the item). A save holding an old name loads it as the RM_ def through RM_DefAliasDef
  (RM_DefAliases.cs). Renamed C# classes (a saved MapComponent, LordJob, plant) follow through the type alias
  in the same file. Only def types a save can hold are listed (no GenStep, Sound, ThinkTree or lottery-table
  rows). AssailantSalvage keeps RUT_: it is a mandrake.rut mod.
-->
